// Whether `t` is a list of bytes buffers. Each buffer is its own block shape
// (IdBytes), so a bytes[] that owns its elements frees them with id_bytes_free
// where a list of lists frees rows with id_list_free.

esc_bytes_list(string t) {
  int ok = is_list_ty(t) == 1 && list_elem(t) == "bytes";
} return int ok;
("bytes[]"):(1)
("int[]"):(0)
("bytes"):(0)
